---
description: "FunkSpace — Testing"
globs: ["**/*.{test,spec}.ts", "**/*.{test,spec}.tsx", "e2e/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

## Unit (Vitest)
- Arrange/Act/Assert; cover happy path + edge cases (empty, nullish, boundary values).
- Avoid network & time dependence; mock/stub IO; keep tests < 200ms each when possible.

## Component tests
- Use @testing-library/react selectors by role/text; assert accessible behavior.

## E2E (Playwright)
- Test core flows only (smoke + auth + publish/view); use stable selectors (data-testids).
- Record traces/screenshots on failure; keep suites parallelizable.

## Quality gates
- Require CI to run lint, typecheck, unit, e2e smoke on PRs.
